{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Binly 是私密收藏空間，讓你集中保存連結、筆記、相片、GIF、PDF、影片與文件，之後需要時快速找回。適合不願把資料散落各處的 Apple 用家；原價 US $1.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>跨裝置同步的私人收藏庫</h2>\n<p>Binly 可保存網頁連結、筆記、相片、GIF、PDF、文件、影片與檔案，並以資料夾、標籤、搜尋及網格或列表檢視整理。內容會透過 iCloud 在 iPhone、iPad 與 Mac 之間自動同步，也可從 Safari 或其他 App 經分享擴充功能直接存入，更可在 App 內拍照保存，避免佔滿相簿。所有資料留在裝置及私人 iCloud 帳戶，毋須註冊 Binly 帳戶，亦無追蹤與廣告。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-87-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-88-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-170-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-89-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-90-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-91-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Binly</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T06:00:58.625703+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}